Pinned Google Fonts commit: 23e54b51ddffbc7713c583748e3bd86f62b1fa4a
Variable file SHA-256: 3ae11c49db0455a3cc33e37d380f20fdb8c7f8b41dc07625c177e3d87a9d6ae6
  (kept as generators/fonts/Manrope-Variable.ttf; LumaShow embeds the same file)

The static faces here are instantiated from it by generators/gen-fonts.py at weights 400, 500, 600
and 700, named family "Manrope" with the weight as the style, which is what Qt's FontLoader and the
web @font-face rules in payload/webapps/lumatv.css take. They render pixel for pixel like the 4.504
statics they replaced (compared at 13 sizes from 14 to 92 px).
